    <string name="about_howto_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="about_howto">• Tap a road to see what it is, or a section to open it.\n• Long-press a place, then: long-press where you want to go, route there from your position, or ride a loop from it.\n• The loop button plans loops from where you are.\n• Mark a section (+) to save a road you like; TAG saves the spot you are on, to review after the ride.\n• The red dot records your ride.</string>
    <string name="about_licence">moto is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only (AGPL-3.0-only). It comes with no warranty.</string>
